</li>\n</ul>\n", "last_modified": 1794875161, "replies": 76, "id": 1257569}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 12110, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2556, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 287977, "username": "bofei", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/bofei", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b238/af0c/287977_mini.png?m=1788405440", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b238/af0c/287977_normal.png?m=1788405440", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b238/af0c/287977_large.png?m=1788405440", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b238/af0c/287977_xlarge.png?m=1788405440", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b238/af0c/287977_xxlarge.png?m=1788405440", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b238/af0c/287977_xxxlarge.png?m=1788405440", "created": 1517293041, "last_modified": 1788405440, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "belowfrog", "last_touched": 1794889777, "title": "跟异性聊天总是没话题，有没有军师指点", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1257456", "created": 1794818426, "deleted": 0, "content": "真有那么多话可说吗？有时候套聊天公式觉得好别扭，好像第一天就把该说的说完了，有没有什么经验分享一下？", "content_rendered": "<p>真有那么多话可说吗？有时候套聊天公式觉得好别扭，好像第一天就把该说的说完了，有没有什么经验分享一下？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1794875921, "replies": 72, "id": 1257456}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 74482, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9831, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 546942, "username": "tmtstudio", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/tmtstudio", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/12bc/1494/546942_mini.png?m=1794807318", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/12bc/1494/546942_normal.png?m=1794807318", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/12bc/1494/546942_large.png?m=1794807318", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/12bc/1494/546942_xlarge.png?m=1794807318", "created": 1622537569, "last_modified": 1794807318, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "frankilla", "last_touched": 1794889547, "title": "AI 离谱越权操作一则，大家引以为戒", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1257395", "created": 1794807501, "deleted": 0, "content": "## 前情提要：\r\n我自己写了一个用于服务器监控运维的的项目，能查看服务器状态，日志解析，自动运维等功能\r\n项目中存储了服务器的 ssh 密钥，运维功不让 ai 直接 ssh 到服务器，写了一个中间层 ai 想操作服务器给中间层申请，中转获取命令执行结果，中间层查看类命令全部放行，修改命令需要审核\r\n\r\n## ai 越权操作\r\n然后因为之前有项目配置了负载均衡导致日志分析出问题了，所以在运维项目的 codex 工作窗口询问是什么原因，有什么差异，还给贴了出问题项目的 nginx 配置文件，然后 ai 跑了半天告诉我改好了，我想去服务器修改一下配置文件呢，一看和 ai 修改的一模一样，当场愣住了，回去看 ai 的回复才发现他妈的把重载都做了，这幸亏修改的没问题，一阵后怕\r\n\r\n![ScreenShot 2026 11 16 133020 653@2x](https://i.mji.rip/2026/11/16/a66a3b5ef605522c86dad307c5e64bd0.png)", "content_rendered": "<h2>前情提要：</h2>\n<p>我自己写了一个用于服务器监控运维的的项目，能查看服务器状态，日志解析，自动运维等功能\n项目中存储了服务器的 ssh 密钥，运维功不让 ai 直接 ssh 到服务器，写了一个中间层 ai 想操作服务器给中间层申请，中转获取命令执行结果，中间层查看类命令全部放行，修改命令需要审核</p>\n<h2>ai 越权操作</h2>\n<p>然后因为之前有项目配置了负载均衡导致日志分析出问题了，所以在运维项目的 codex 工作窗口询问是什么原因，有什么差异，还给贴了出问题项目的 nginx 配置文件，然后 ai 跑了半天告诉我改好了，我想去服务器修改一下配置文件呢，一看和 ai 修改的一模一样，当场愣住了，回去看 ai 的回复才发现他妈的把重载都做了，这幸亏修改